        "original_id": "85157ac9-0598-5827-883f-2d41eff905d2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Smooth Talker\n- People: Kate Tsui, Joe Ma, Johnson Lee, Elena Kong, Tommy Wong, Tracy Chu\n- Organizations: TVB, Television Broadcasts Limited\n- Topics: Hong Kong television drama, romantic comedy, Miss Hong Kong\n\nFacts:\n- Kate Tsui won the Miss Hong Kong 2004 title.\n- Smooth Talker, literally \"Harmony Is Precious,\" is a 2015 Hong Kong romantic comedy television drama created and produced by TVB.\n- Smooth Talker stars Joe Ma and Kate Tsui as the main leads.\n- Smooth Talker features Johnson Lee, Elena Kong, Tommy Wong, and Tracy Chu in main supporting roles.\n- Kate Tsui Tsz-shan is a Hong Kong actress best known for her work with Television Broadcasts Limited (TVB) and also for some film work.",
